# §506. What `railway up` must not upload.
#
# Railway's uploader reads this file, not `.dockerignore`, and with neither in
# place the first `railway up` was refused by Cloudflare with 413 Payload Too
# Large — 1.8 GB of `.git`, `node_modules`, generated media and render output,
# none of which the Dockerfile uses. Kept in step with `.dockerignore`: what
# the build does not read, the upload does not carry.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
.render-output
apps/web/public/dev-assets
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp
